⚙️ GRU Implementation (TensorFlow)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```python id="gru_tf"
from tensorflow import keras
from tensorflow.keras import layers

model = keras.Sequential([
    layers.GRU(64, input_shape=(timesteps, features)),
    layers.Dense(1)
])

model.compile(
    optimizer='adam',
    loss='mse'
)

model.fit(X_train, y_train, epochs=10)
```

