🔧 GRU Implementation (PyTorch)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```python id="gru_pt"
import torch
import torch.nn as nn

class GRUModel(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.gru = nn.GRU(input_size=1, hidden_size=64, batch_first=True)
        self.fc = nn.Linear(64, 1)

    def forward(self, x):
        out, _ = self.gru(x)
        out = self.fc(out[:, -1, :])
        return out
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔁 Bidirectional GRU (PyTorch)

---

```python id="bigru_pt"
self.gru = nn.GRU(
    input_size=1,
    hidden_size=64,
    batch_first=True,
    bidirectional=True
)

self.fc = nn.Linear(64*2, 1)
```

